        a                   crmsci:S4_Observation ;
        ecrm:P2_has_type    <http://data.silknow.org/observation/technical-observation> ;
        ecrm:P3_has_note    "Satin brocade dress with silk ribbon and chenille embroidery. The embroidery pattern consists of detached bunches of flowers and long blossoming stems in colours (red, yellow, white, and shades of green and mauve) on a champagne-coloured ground. The satin brocade is possibly Spitalfields weaving"@en ;
